{
  "sheet": "stats",
  "about": "Every ROUNDS stat a card can change (from ROUNDS ApplyCardStats.ApplyStats / CopyGunStats). The ROUNDS card engine folds each picked card into a Build with these ops; the Cuphead blob consumes the result through the named effect.",
